<body>

<!-- ============================================================ -->
<!-- TAB 1: INTRODUCTION -->
<!-- ============================================================ -->
<div id="sheet1">
<h2>Introduction</h2>
<table>
<tr><th colspan="4">Mercy Court RCCG — Elementor Build Guide</th></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><strong>Overview:</strong> This workbook provides a complete, step-by-step guide for rebuilding the Mercy Court RCCG website in WordPress + Elementor Pro. Each tab covers a specific page or component. Every section includes exact pixel values, hex colors, font specifications, and widget-level instructions so a developer can recreate each page without referencing the original HTML source code. The site uses the Hello Elementor theme with Elementor Pro, Google Fonts (Anton + Lato), and a consistent brand color palette anchored by #D95A2B (Brand Red) and #0A0A0A (Brand Dark).</td></tr>

<tr><td colspan="4" class="section-header">Design System Quick Reference</td></tr>
<tr class="sub-header"><td>Token</td><td>Value</td><td>Usage</td><td>Notes</td></tr>
<tr><td>Brand Red (Primary)</td><td>#D95A2B</td><td>Buttons, accents, highlights, active nav</td><td>Tailwind: brand-red</td></tr>
<tr><td>Brand Red Hover</td><td>#C04E25</td><td>Button hover states</td><td>Darker shade for interaction</td></tr>
<tr><td>Brand Dark</td><td>#0A0A0A</td><td>Dark section backgrounds, primary text</td><td>Tailwind: brand-dark</td></tr>
<tr><td>Brand Footer</td><td>#1a1a1a</td><td>Footer background</td><td>Tailwind: brand-footer</td></tr>
<tr><td>White</td><td>#FFFFFF</td><td>Light section backgrounds, button text</td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>Body Text</td><td>#111827</td><td>Default body text (gray-900)</td><td>Tailwind: text-gray-900</td></tr>
<tr><td>Muted Text</td><td>#6B7280</td><td>Secondary/description text (gray-500)</td><td>Tailwind: text-gray-500</td></tr>
<tr><td>Light Text</td><td>#9CA3AF</td><td>Footer links, subtle text (gray-400)</td><td>Tailwind: text-gray-400</td></tr>
<tr><td>Primary Font</td><td>Anton</td><td>All headings (H1-H3)</td><td>Google Fonts, weight 400</td></tr>
<tr><td>Secondary Font</td><td>Lato</td><td>Body text, buttons, UI elements</td><td>Google Fonts, weights 300/400/700/900</td></tr>

<tr><td colspan="4" class="section-header">Tailwind to Elementor Pixel Mapping</td></tr>
<tr class="sub-header"><td>Tailwind Class</td><td>Pixels</td><td>Elementor Setting</td><td>Context</td></tr>
<tr><td>text-xs</td><td>12px</td><td>Typography &gt; Size: 12px</td><td>Labels, tags</td></tr>
<tr><td>text-sm</td><td>14px</td><td>Typography &gt; Size: 14px</td><td>Buttons, nav links, small text</td></tr>
<tr><td>text-base</td><td>16px</td><td>Typography &gt; Size: 16px</td><td>Body text default</td></tr>
<tr><td>text-lg</td><td>18px</td><td>Typography &gt; Size: 18px</td><td>Lead paragraphs</td></tr>
<tr><td>text-xl</td><td>20px</td><td>Typography &gt; Size: 20px</td><td>Sub-headings</td></tr>
<tr><td>text-2xl</td><td>24px</td><td>Typography &gt; Size: 24px</td><td>Card headings</td></tr>
<tr><td>text-3xl</td><td>30px</td><td>Typography &gt; Size: 30px</td><td>Section sub-heads</td></tr>
<tr><td>text-4xl</td><td>36px</td><td>Typography &gt; Size: 36px</td><td>Section headings (mobile)</td></tr>
<tr><td>text-5xl</td><td>48px</td><td>Typography &gt; Size: 48px</td><td>Section headings (desktop)</td></tr>
<tr><td>text-6xl</td><td>60px</td><td>Typography &gt; Size: 60px</td><td>Large headings</td></tr>
<tr><td>text-7xl</td><td>72px</td><td>Typography &gt; Size: 72px</td><td>Hero headings (tablet)</td></tr>
<tr><td>text-8xl</td><td>96px</td><td>Typography &gt; Size: 96px</td><td>Hero headings (desktop)</td></tr>
<tr><td>text-9xl</td><td>128px</td><td>Typography &gt; Size: 128px</td><td>Hero heading (homepage)</td></tr>
<tr><td>py-4</td><td>16px top/bottom</td><td>Padding: 16px 0</td><td>Nav bar</td></tr>
<tr><td>px-6</td><td>24px left/right</td><td>Padding: 0 24px</td><td>Section horizontal padding</td></tr>
<tr><td>py-12</td><td>48px top/bottom</td><td>Padding: 48px 0</td><td>Footer</td></tr>
<tr><td>py-16</td><td>64px top/bottom</td><td>Padding: 64px 0</td><td>Mailing list section</td></tr>
<tr><td>py-20</td><td>80px top/bottom</td><td>Padding: 80px 0</td><td>Standard sections</td></tr>
<tr><td>py-24</td><td>96px top/bottom</td><td>Padding: 96px 0</td><td>Major sections</td></tr>
<tr><td>py-32</td><td>128px top/bottom</td><td>Padding: 128px 0</td><td>Mission statement</td></tr>
<tr><td>gap-4</td><td>16px</td><td>Gap / Spacing: 16px</td><td>Button groups</td></tr>
<tr><td>gap-8</td><td>32px</td><td>Gap / Spacing: 32px</td><td>Grid gaps, nav links</td></tr>
<tr><td>gap-12</td><td>48px</td><td>Gap / Spacing: 48px</td><td>2-col section gaps</td></tr>
<tr><td>gap-16</td><td>64px</td><td>Gap / Spacing: 64px</td><td>About section gap</td></tr>
<tr><td>rounded-full</td><td>9999px</td><td>Border Radius: 9999px</td><td>Pill buttons, tags</td></tr>
<tr><td>rounded-lg</td><td>8px</td><td>Border Radius: 8px</td><td>Cards, images</td></tr>
<tr><td>rounded-xl</td><td>12px</td><td>Border Radius: 12px</td><td>Ministry cards</td></tr>

<tr><td colspan="4" class="section-header">Workbook Tab Index</td></tr>
<tr class="sub-header"><td>Tab #</td><td>Tab Name</td><td>Link</td><td>Description</td></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td>Introduction</td><td><a href="#sheet1">Introduction</a></td><td>This page — overview, design tokens, pixel mapping</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td>Design System Setup</td><td><a href="#sheet2">Design System Setup</a></td><td>WordPress install, global colors, fonts, buttons, layout, menus, Theme Builder</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td>Header</td><td><a href="#sheet3">Header</a></td><td>Shared navigation bar (Theme Builder template)</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td>Footer</td><td><a href="#sheet4">Footer</a></td><td>Shared footer, Give section, Mailing List (Theme Builder template + reusable sections)</td></tr>
<tr><td>5</td><td>Homepage</td><td><a href="#sheet5">Homepage</a></td><td>index.html — Hero, About, Mission, Services, Leadership, Ministries, CTA</td></tr>
<tr><td>6</td><td>About</td><td><a href="#sheet6">About</a></td><td>who-we-are.html — Hero, Mission, Beliefs, Approach, Pastor, Testimonials + Pastor Bio &amp; Vision (formerly Meet PJ)</td></tr>
<tr><td>7</td><td>Ministries</td><td><a href="#sheet7">Ministries</a></td><td>ministries.html — Ministry cards, Get Involved CTA</td></tr>
<tr><td>8</td><td>Give</td><td><a href="#sheet8">Give</a></td><td>give.html — Giving page</td></tr>
<tr><td>9</td><td>Contact</td><td><a href="#sheet9">Contact</a></td><td>contact.html — Location, form, map</td></tr>
<tr><td>10</td><td>Watch Live</td><td><a href="#sheet10">Watch Live</a></td><td>watch-live.html — Live stream embed</td></tr>
<tr><td>11</td><td>Community Impact</td><td><a href="#sheet11">Community Impact</a></td><td>Community outreach page</td></tr>
<tr><td>12</td><td>Quick Links</td><td><a href="#sheet12">Quick Links</a></td><td>quick-links.html — Resource links</td></tr>
<tr><td>13</td><td>Mercy Kidz</td><td><a href="#sheet13">Mercy Kidz</a></td><td>Children's ministry page</td></tr>
<tr><td>14</td><td>The New MC</td><td><a href="#sheet14">The New MC</a></td><td>New members page</td></tr>
<tr><td>15</td><td>Blog</td><td><a href="#sheet15">Blog</a></td><td>Blog archive + single post template</td></tr>
<tr><td>16</td><td>SEO Reporting Tracking</td><td><a href="#sheet16">SEO Reporting Tracking</a></td><td>SEO setup, analytics, tracking codes</td></tr>
</table>
</div>

<!-- ============================================================ -->
<!-- TAB 2: DESIGN SYSTEM SETUP -->
<!-- ============================================================ -->
<div id="sheet2">
<h2>Design System Setup</h2>
<table>
<tr><th colspan="4">Design System Setup — Complete Elementor Configuration</th></tr>

<!-- Section A -->
<tr><td colspan="4" class="section-header">Section A: WordPress Setup</td></tr>
<tr class="sub-header"><td>Step</td><td>Action</td><td>Details</td><td>Notes</td></tr>
<tr><td>A1</td><td>Install WordPress</td><td>Install WordPress 6.x on hosting. Set site title to "Mercy Court RCCG". Set tagline to "The Home of Pacesetters".</td><td>Use latest stable WordPress version</td></tr>
<tr><td>A2</td><td>Install Hello Elementor Theme</td><td>Go to Appearance &gt; Themes &gt; Add New. Search "Hello Elementor". Install and activate.</td><td>This is Elementor's lightweight starter theme — no bloat</td></tr>
<tr><td>A3</td><td>Install Elementor Pro</td><td>Upload Elementor Pro plugin zip via Plugins &gt; Add New &gt; Upload. Activate and enter license key. Also ensure free Elementor plugin is installed first.</td><td>Pro required for Theme Builder (header/footer), forms, popups</td></tr>
<tr><td>A4</td><td>Remove Default Pages</td><td>Go to Pages &gt; All Pages. Trash "Sample Page" and "Privacy Policy" (if not needed). Empty trash.</td><td>Clean slate</td></tr>
<tr><td>A5</td><td>Set Static Homepage</td><td>Create a page called "Home". Go to Settings &gt; Reading &gt; Select "A static page". Set Homepage to "Home". Optionally create and set a "Blog" posts page.</td><td>Ensures homepage is not the blog feed</td></tr>

<!-- Section B -->
<tr><td colspan="4" class="section-header">Section B: Global Colors</td></tr>
<tr class="sub-header"><td>Color Name</td><td>Hex Value</td><td>Usage</td><td>Elementor Path: Site Settings &gt; Global Colors</td></tr>
<tr><td>Brand Red (Primary)</td><td>#D95A2B</td><td>Buttons, accents, highlights, active nav links, CTA backgrounds</td><td>Set as Primary color</td></tr>
<tr><td>Brand Red Hover</td><td>#C04E25</td><td>Button hover states</td><td>Add as custom global color</td></tr>
<tr><td>Brand Dark</td><td>#0A0A0A</td><td>Dark section backgrounds, primary heading text on light BG</td><td>Set as Text color</td></tr>
<tr><td>Brand Footer</td><td>#1a1a1a</td><td>Footer background color</td><td>Add as custom global color</td></tr>
<tr><td>White</td><td>#FFFFFF</td><td>Light section backgrounds, button text on dark/red BG</td><td>Add as custom global color</td></tr>
<tr><td>Body Text</td><td>#111827</td><td>Default body text color (Tailwind gray-900)</td><td>Set as body text default</td></tr>
<tr><td>Muted Text</td><td>#6B7280</td><td>Secondary text, descriptions (Tailwind gray-500)</td><td>Add as custom global color</td></tr>
<tr><td>Light Text</td><td>#9CA3AF</td><td>Footer links, subtle text (Tailwind gray-400)</td><td>Add as custom global color</td></tr>

<!-- Section C -->
<tr><td colspan="4" class="section-header">Section C: Global Fonts</td></tr>
<tr class="sub-header"><td>Font Role</td><td>Font Family</td><td>Source</td><td>Weights to Load</td></tr>
<tr><td>Primary / Headings</td><td>Anton</td><td>Google Fonts (Elementor &gt; Site Settings &gt; Global Fonts &gt; Primary)</td><td>400 (Regular) — Anton only has one weight</td></tr>
<tr><td>Secondary / Body</td><td>Lato</td><td>Google Fonts (Elementor &gt; Site Settings &gt; Global Fonts &gt; Secondary)</td><td>300 (Light), 400 (Regular), 700 (Bold), 900 (Black)</td></tr>

<!-- Section D -->
<tr><td colspan="4" class="section-header">Section D: Typography Defaults (Site Settings &gt; Typography)</td></tr>
<tr class="sub-header"><td>Element</td><td>Font Family</td><td>Size / Weight</td><td>Additional Settings</td></tr>
<tr><td>H1</td><td>Anton</td><td>96px / 400</td><td>Transform: Uppercase. Line Height: 1.1. Letter Spacing: -0.5px. Responsive: Tablet 72px, Mobile 48px.</td></tr>
<tr><td>H2</td><td>Anton</td><td>48px / 400</td><td>Transform: Uppercase. Line Height: 1.15. Letter Spacing: -0.25px. Responsive: Tablet 36px, Mobile 30px.</td></tr>
<tr><td>H3</td><td>Anton</td><td>30px / 400</td><td>Transform: Uppercase. Line Height: 1.2. Responsive: Tablet 24px, Mobile 20px.</td></tr>
<tr><td>H4</td><td>Lato</td><td>20px / 700</td><td>Transform: Uppercase. Line Height: 1.4.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Body (p)</td><td>Lato</td><td>16px / 400</td><td>Line Height: 1.6 (relaxed). Color: #111827.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Body Small</td><td>Lato</td><td>14px / 400</td><td>Line Height: 1.5. Color: #6B7280. Used for descriptions, fine print.</td></tr>

<!-- Section E -->
<tr><td colspan="4" class="section-header">Section E: Button Defaults (Site Settings &gt; Buttons)</td></tr>
<tr class="sub-header"><td>Property</td><td>Value</td><td>Elementor Path</td><td>Notes</td></tr>
<tr><td>Font Family</td><td>Lato</td><td>Typography &gt; Family</td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>Font Size</td><td>14px</td><td>Typography &gt; Size</td><td>Matches text-sm</td></tr>
<tr><td>Font Weight</td><td>700 (Bold)</td><td>Typography &gt; Weight</td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>Text Transform</td><td>Uppercase</td><td>Typography &gt; Transform</td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>Letter Spacing</td><td>0.5px</td><td>Typography &gt; Letter Spacing</td><td>tracking-wide equivalent</td></tr>
<tr><td>Background Color</td><td>#D95A2B</td><td>Style &gt; Background</td><td>Brand Red</td></tr>
<tr><td>Text Color</td><td>#FFFFFF</td><td>Style &gt; Text Color</td><td>White</td></tr>
<tr><td>Border Radius</td><td>9999px</td><td>Style &gt; Border Radius</td><td>Pill shape (rounded-full)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Padding</td><td>12px top/bottom, 32px left/right</td><td>Style &gt; Padding</td><td>Matches py-3 px-8</td></tr>
<tr><td>Hover Background</td><td>#C04E25</td><td>Style &gt; Hover &gt; Background</td><td>Darker red on hover</td></tr>
<tr><td>Hover Text Color</td><td>#FFFFFF</td><td>Style &gt; Hover &gt; Text Color</td><td>Stays white</td></tr>

<!-- Section F -->
<tr><td colspan="4" class="section-header">Section F: Layout (Site Settings &gt; Layout)</td></tr>
<tr class="sub-header"><td>Setting</td><td>Value</td><td>Elementor Path</td><td>Notes</td></tr>
<tr><td>Content Width</td><td>1280px</td><td>Site Settings &gt; Layout &gt; Content Width</td><td>Matches max-w-7xl (1280px)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Widgets Space</td><td>20px</td><td>Site Settings &gt; Layout &gt; Widgets Space</td><td>Default gap between stacked widgets</td></tr>
<tr><td>Stretched Section Padding</td><td>24px left/right</td><td>Site Settings &gt; Layout &gt; Stretched Section Padding</td><td>Matches px-6 (24px)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Page Layout Default</td><td>Elementor Full Width</td><td>Site Settings &gt; Layout &gt; Default Page Layout</td><td>No sidebar, full control</td></tr>

<!-- Section G -->
<tr><td colspan="4" class="section-header">Section G: WordPress Menu (Appearance &gt; Menus)</td></tr>
<tr class="sub-header"><td>Menu Name</td><td>Menu Item</td><td>Link Target</td><td>Notes</td></tr>
<tr><td rowspan="6">Main Navigation</td><td>Home</td><td>index.html (Homepage)</td><td>First nav item</td></tr>
<tr><td>About</td><td>who-we-are.html</td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>Ministries</td><td>ministries.html</td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>Watch Live</td><td>watch-live.html</td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>Blog</td><td>Blog page</td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>Contact</td><td>contact.html</td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>Separate CTA Button</td><td>Give</td><td>give.html</td><td>Styled as button in header — not part of standard menu. Use Elementor Button widget separately or custom CSS class on menu item.</td></tr>

<!-- Section H -->
<tr><td colspan="4" class="section-header">Section H: Theme Builder Templates (Elementor &gt; Templates &gt; Theme Builder)</td></tr>
<tr class="sub-header"><td>Template Type</td><td>Template Name</td><td>Display Condition</td><td>Notes</td></tr>
<tr><td>Header</td><td>MC Header</td><td>Entire Site</td><td>Fixed header with logo, nav, Give CTA. See Header tab for full build steps.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Footer</td><td>MC Footer</td><td>Entire Site</td><td>4-column footer with copyright. See Footer tab for full build steps.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Single Post</td><td>MC Blog Post</td><td>All Posts</td><td>Custom blog post layout. See Blog tab for build steps.</td></tr>

<!-- Section I -->
<tr><td colspan="4" class="section-header">Section I: Reusable Sections (Elementor &gt; Templates &gt; Saved Templates)</td></tr>
<tr class="sub-header"><td>Template Name</td><td>Type</td><td>Used On</td><td>Notes</td></tr>
<tr><td>MC Give Section</td><td>Section Template</td><td>All pages except Give page. Appears above Mailing List section.</td><td>White bg, border-left 4px #D95A2B, heading "Give to Mercy Court", two buttons (Give Now + Building Project). See Footer tab for exact build.</td></tr>
<tr><td>MC Mailing List</td><td>Section Template</td><td>All pages. Appears above footer.</td><td>Red bg (#D95A2B), heading "JOIN OUR MAILING LIST", email input + submit button. See Footer tab for exact build.</td></tr>

<!-- Section J -->
<tr><td colspan="4" class="section-header">Section J: Media Uploads (Media Library)</td></tr>
<tr class="sub-header"><td>File</td><td>Source URL</td><td>Used On</td><td>Notes</td></tr>
<tr><td>Logo</td><td>https://mercycourt.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/cropped-cropped-mERCYCOURT-LOGO-2.png</td><td>Header (all pages)</td><td>Height: 40px (h-10). Upload to Media Library.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Homepage Hero</td><td>https://mercycourt.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/IMG_9775-1536x1024.jpg</td><td>Homepage hero section</td><td>Full viewport background image</td></tr>
<tr><td>About Community Photo</td><td>https://mercycourt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/IMG_8074-scaled.jpg</td><td>Homepage about section, About page hero, About We Believe section</td><td>Multiple uses across site</td></tr>
<tr><td>Pastor Photo</td><td>https://mercycourt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/PJ-and-PA-731x1024.jpeg</td><td>Homepage leadership, About page pastor, About page pastor bio section</td><td>Portrait orientation, use object-cover object-top</td></tr>
<tr><td>Worship Ministry</td><td>https://mercycourt.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/MC-4-1024x536.jpg</td><td>Homepage ministries, About page, Ministries page</td><td>Landscape, worship scene</td></tr>
<tr><td>Kids/Community</td><td>https://mercycourt.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/MC-5-1-1024x536.jpg</td><td>Homepage ministries, About page, Ministries hero + cards</td><td>Landscape, community scene</td></tr>
<tr><td>Outreach</td><td>https://mercycourt.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/MC-8-1024x536.jpg</td><td>Homepage ministries, Ministries page cards</td><td>Landscape, outreach scene</td></tr>
<tr><td>Church Background</td><td>https://mercycourt.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/MC-11-1024x536.jpg</td><td>Homepage CTA, About We Believe bg, About page vision section</td><td>Used as overlay background</td></tr>
</table>
</div>

<!-- ============================================================ -->
<!-- TAB 3: HEADER -->
<!-- ============================================================ -->
<div id="sheet3">
<h2>Header (Shared Navigation)</h2>
<table>
<tr><th colspan="11">Header — Theme Builder Template "MC Header" — Display Condition: Entire Site</th></tr>
<tr><td colspan="11"><strong>Source:</strong> Extracted from nav element across all pages. Fixed position, semi-transparent black background with blur, z-index 50. Contains logo, horizontal menu, Give CTA button, and mobile hamburger toggle.</td></tr>

<tr class="sub-header">
