<td>—</td>
<td>—</td>
<td>Container height: 480px. Image 1: top 0, left 0. Image 2: top 15%, right 0. Image 3: bottom 0, left 10%.</td>
<td>Position: Relative for container. Each image: Position Absolute.</td>
<td>All images: rounded-lg (8px), shadow-xl. Z-index layering: Image1 z-10, Image2 z-20, Image3 z-30.</td>
<td>Mobile: Consider stacking images vertically or showing single image instead of collage.</td>
<td>This layered/overlapping image collage requires absolute positioning. In Elementor, use a Container with min-height 480px. Add 3 Image widgets inside, each with Custom Positioning (Position: Absolute). Adjust top/left/right/bottom values for each. Alternative: Use a single featured image on mobile.</td>
</tr>

