<tr><td>12</td><td>Pastor Bio</td><td>Text Editor</td><td>Pastor John Itakpe serves as the lead pastor (Father-on-Seat) of Mercy Court RCCG, bringing a heart for God's people and a passion for seeing lives transformed. His ministry is characterized by a deep love for the Word of God and a genuine care for every member of the congregation.</td><td>Font: Lato; Size: 18px (text-lg); Weight: 400; Line-height: relaxed (1.625)</td><td>Text: #4B5563 (gray-600)</td><td>Margin Bottom: 24px (mb-6)</td><td>Text Align: Left</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>Paragraph 1</td></tr>
<tr><td>13</td><td>Pastor Bio</td><td>Text Editor</td><td>Under his leadership, Mercy Court has become a thriving community of believers committed to excellence, spiritual growth, and Kingdom impact. Pastor John believes that every person has a God-given potential waiting to be unlocked, and he is dedicated to helping people discover and maximize that potential.</td><td>Font: Lato; Size: 18px; Weight: 400; Line-height: 1.625</td><td>Text: #4B5563</td><td>Margin Bottom: 24px (mb-6)</td><td>Text Align: Left</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>Paragraph 2</td></tr>
<tr><td>14</td><td>Pastor Bio</td><td>Text Editor</td><td>Together with Pastor (Mrs) Itakpe, they lead the church with a vision of raising Christ-like pacesetters who through God's mercy maximize their potentials and enjoy life.</td><td>Font: Lato; Size: 18px; Weight: 400; Line-height: 1.625</td><td>Text: #4B5563</td><td>Margin Bottom: 0</td><td>Text Align: Left</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>Paragraph 3</td></tr>

