<tr><td>24</td><td>Vision</td><td>Text Editor</td><td>Pastor John's vision for Mercy Court is to build a church where every member is empowered to be a pacesetter in their sphere of influence. He envisions a community where faith is not just practiced on Sundays, but lived out every day.</td><td>Font: Lato; Size: 18px; Weight: 400; Line-height: 1.625</td><td>Text: #4B5563</td><td>Margin Bottom: 24px</td><td>Text Align: Left</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>Paragraph 1</td></tr>
<tr><td>25</td><td>Vision</td><td>Text Editor</td><td>This vision encompasses spiritual growth, personal development, family strengthening, and community impact. At Mercy Court, we don't just attend church — we are the church, making a difference wherever we go.</td><td>Font: Lato; Size: 18px; Weight: 400; Line-height: 1.625</td><td>Text: #4B5563</td><td>Margin Bottom: 24px</td><td>Text Align: Left</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>Paragraph 2</td></tr>
