<td>Notes</td>
<td>—</td>
<td colspan="9">BLOG IMPLEMENTATION: The hero carousel can be built using Elementor Pro's Slides widget with fade transition and 5s autoplay. The blog posts grid should use Elementor Pro's Posts widget or Loop Grid widget to dynamically pull posts from WordPress. Set the query to show 6 posts per page with the Load More pagination option. Category filtering can use the Posts widget's built-in taxonomy filter or a custom solution with JetSmartFilters. Each post should have a Featured Image, Category taxonomy, and excerpt configured in WordPress. The Featured Post can be a sticky post or manually selected via Elementor's Query settings.</td>
</tr>

