</tr>

<tr>
<td colspan="3">Top Pages</td>
<td colspan="3">Google Analytics 4</td>
<td colspan="2">Weekly</td>
<td colspan="3">Most visited pages, time on page, exit rate. Track /give, /watch-live, /contact specifically.</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td colspan="3">Search Performance</td>
<td colspan="3">Google Search Console</td>
<td colspan="2">Weekly</td>
